Revision history for UUID-V7

0.004     2026-11-12 01:56:27+01:00 Europe/Brussels
          - Use Postgresql's calculation method for submilliseconds.
          - Check ivsize instead of use64bitint in Build.PL

0.003     2026-11-11 22:40:44+01:00 Europe/Brussels
          - Explicitly require a perl with 64-bit integers
          - Require POSIX::RT::Clock 0.024 for Time::Spec support
          - Make test more tolerant for lower-precision systems

0.002     2026-11-06 17:28:22+01:00 Europe/Brussels
          - Add extract_uuid_v7_time, uuid_string_to_binary,
            uuid_binary_to_string and is_uuid_v7
          - Skip uniqueness test on systems with imprecise clocks

0.001     2026-11-06 00:04:40+01:00 Europe/Brussels
          - Initial release
